      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020007000720075006500620061002000640065002000610067007500610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Explícamelo todo de nuevo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500780070006C00ED00630061006D0065006C006F00200074006F0064006F0020006400650020006E007500650076006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ninguna",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0069006E00670075006E00610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, son tres pruebas en total, y en cada una de\nellas tienes que usar a un Pokémon específico<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny ganarles en combate a otros tres.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero con ganas el momento en el que superes\nlas tres pruebas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F00200063006F006E002000670061006E0061007300200065006C0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F00200065006E00200065006C002000710075006500200073007500700065007200650073000A006C006100730020007400720065007300200070007200750065006200610073002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En la prueba de planta es imprescindible contar\nsolo con un Meganium.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006C0061002000700072007500650062006100200064006500200070006C0061006E0074006100200065007300200069006D007000720065007300630069006E006400690062006C006500200063006F006E007400610072000A0073006F006C006F00200063006F006E00200075006E0020004D006500670061006E00690075006D002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En la prueba de fuego es imprescindible contar\nsolo con un Emboar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006C0061002000700072007500650062006100200064006500200066007500650067006F00200065007300200069006D007000720065007300630069006E006400690062006C006500200063006F006E007400610072000A0073006F006C006F00200063006F006E00200075006E00200045006D0062006F00610072002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En la prueba de agua es imprescindible contar\nsolo con un Feraligatr.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006C006100200070007200750065006200610020006400650020006100670075006100200065007300200069006D007000720065007300630069006E006400690062006C006500200063006F006E007400610072000A0073006F006C006F00200063006F006E00200075006E00200046006500720061006C00690067006100740072002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muy bien, que empiece la prueba de planta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500790020006200690065006E002C002000710075006500200065006D007000690065006300650020006C0061002000700072007500650062006100200064006500200070006C0061006E00740061002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muy bien, que empiece la prueba de fuego.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500790020006200690065006E002C002000710075006500200065006D007000690065006300650020006C0061002000700072007500650062006100200064006500200066007500650067006F002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muy bien, que empiece la prueba de agua.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
